---
// Art. 50 disclosure page (SDD D10). Draft: copy pending founder sign-off (SDD §13).
import SubpageLayout from '../../../layouts/SubpageLayout.astro';
---

<SubpageLayout
  lang="en"
  title="About our AI assistant"
  subtitle="How the assistant on this site works, what it can and cannot do, and how we handle your data."
  seoDescription="About the AI Heroes AI assistant: capabilities, limits, data handling and how to reach a human."
  accentColor="blue"
  showContactForm={false}
  noindex
>
  <div class="prose prose-lg max-w-none">
    <h2 class="text-2xl md:text-3xl font-serif text-brand-dark mb-6">You are chatting with AI</h2>
    <p class="text-stone-600 leading-relaxed mb-8">
      The chat assistant on aiheroes.io is an AI system, built by AI Heroes itself. We also say
      so in the conversation: you always know you are talking to AI, as required by the EU AI
      Act (Article 50). The assistant is an example of what we build for clients.
    </p>

    <div class="bg-stone-50 p-6 md:p-8 mb-8 border-l-4 border-brand-blue not-prose">
      <h3 class="text-xl font-serif text-brand-dark mb-3">In short</h3>
      <ul class="space-y-2 text-stone-600 list-disc ml-5">
        <li>The assistant answers from our own site content and links its sources</li>
        <li>Answers can be incomplete or wrong; verify important information on the linked pages</li>
        <li>A human is always reachable via "Talk to a human" in the chat</li>
        <li>Processing and storage happen within the EU</li>
        <li>We only ask for your name and email when you choose to hand the conversation to the team, with your consent</li>
      </ul>
    </div>

    <h2 class="text-2xl font-serif text-brand-dark mb-4">What the assistant can do</h2>
    <p class="text-stone-600 leading-relaxed mb-6">
      Answer questions about our services, cases, team, articles and the AI Salon; take you to
      the right page; help you book a conversation with the team; and hand the conversation to
      a human. It only quotes pricing that is published on this site.
    </p>

    <h2 class="text-2xl font-serif text-brand-dark mb-4">Data and retention</h2>
    <p class="text-stone-600 leading-relaxed mb-6">
      Your chat history lives in your own browser. On our servers, conversations are stored
      pseudonymously (no name, no IP address, no profile) for quality improvement, for at most
      30 days. Only when you leave your name and email to get in touch do we process personal
      data, in line with our <a href="/en/legal/privacy">privacy policy</a>.
    </p>

    <h2 class="text-2xl font-serif text-brand-dark mb-4">Prefer a human right away?</h2>
    <p class="text-stone-600 leading-relaxed mb-6">
      Use "Talk to a human" in the chat, or reach us via the
      <a href="/en#contact">contact form</a>. During office hours we respond within 4 hours.
    </p>
  </div>
</SubpageLayout>
